  "description": "An application on EC2 needs S3 access. Instead of embedding a long-term access key in the AMI, what should be used?",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>퀴즈</span></nav><section class=\"quiz-page\"><div class=\"quiz-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">QUESTION 061</p><h1>퀴즈</h1></div><strong>61 / 108</strong></div><div class=\"quiz-progress\" aria-label=\"61번째 문제\"><span style=\"width:56%\"></span></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q061\" data-question=\"Q061\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q061</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application on EC2 needs S3 access. Instead of embedding a long-term access key in the AMI, what should be used?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q061\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Embed the root account key</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q061\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Make the S3 bucket public</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q061\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Assign an IAM role to the EC2 instance</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q061\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Allow all traffic in the network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> 역할을 통한 임시 자격 증명과 최소 권한 정책이 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">AMI</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"문제 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q060/\">이전 문제 <b>Q060</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q062/\">다음 문제 <b>Q062</b></a></span></nav><p class=\"save-note\">선택과 채점 결과는 이 브라우저에 자동 저장됩니다.</p></section>"
